        {
          "Id": "mason_q_overview",
          "PromptText": "Certainly, I would love to. Implants are carefully crafted devices that are installed into key locations all throughout your body. They significantly enhance specific attributes and abilities, depending on how they are configured.\\n\\nA single implant can improve up to 3 skills. The skills that can be improved by an implant are based on the location of the implant. For example, a augmentation to your Right Hand could increase your proficiency with a pistol, or hand-to-hand combat. The skills that an implant boosts depends on the \"clusters\" that are imbued inside of it.\\n\\nTo install an implant, it is easiest to utilize one of the stationary surgery clinics, such as the one here in this facility. After paying a small fee, you will be able to install your own implants. Of course, you can only have one implant per location, and you must remove the old one before installing a new one.\\n\\nImplants can make the seemingly impossible possible, by improving all aspects of your physical or mental prowess.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-225905 20:59:26.908 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
