        {
          "Id": "mason_q_where",
          "PromptText": "There are 13 locations that can receive an implant: Eyes, Head, Ears, Right Arm, Left Arm, Chest, Right Wrist, Left Wrist, Waist, Right Hand, Left Hand, Legs, and Feet.\\n\\nThe skills available to be boosted are related to the intended location of the augmentation. You will find that implants that improve your ability to control nanomachines, for example, will mostly be placed in the head, ears, or eyes, while combat skills are focused around the arms and hands.\\n\\nDue to physical limitations, a body can only receive a single implant in each location. As good as it'd be for business, it would just be too dangerous to install so many augmentations in one location.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-225905 20:59:29.276 Unknown2=0",
