        {
          "Id": "mason_q_clusters",
          "PromptText": "There are 3 kinds of augmentation \"clusters,\" and those are, by order of power: Shiny, Bright, and Faded. It is very important to note that an implant can have a maximum of only 1 of each type of cluster. It is impossible to assemble an implant with more than 3 clusers, and more than 1 of each flavor of cluster.\\n\\nAll skills have clusters available in all 3 types. That being said, no single implant can contain multiple clusters of the same skill. Instead, in order to receive the maximum available improvement for a particular skill, you will need to spread it over 3 different implants. This often presents interesting decisions that need to be made...will you improve your body's overall power, or will you refine a specific skill?",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-225905 20:59:34.038 Unknown2=0 (capture spelling clusers)",
          "Options": [
